  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math> in the emitter current brings a change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math> in the collector current. The values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are</p>\r",
